OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with areas of low
OL,7,Fcloud but also some clearer breaks at
OL,8,Ftimes. Outbreaks of rain will spread
OL,9,Fnorth towards Orkney through the early
OL,10,Fhours with freshening easterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain,
OL,13,Flikely turning heavy at times through
OL,14,Fthe afternoon. Strengthening
OL,15,Fnortheasterly winds developing.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,18,Fand stronger winds clearing early
OL,19,FSaturday. Then some drier and bright
OL,20,Fspells over the weekend and on Monday
OL,21,Fbut also a few showers at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
